    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I’m about to tell them off when I suddenly realize they’re not staring at me, exactly—but at the space just above my hea",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1559
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them—someone who joined the Agency a few decades before I did—points a shaking finger at that space. “What is",
          "ok": true,
